{"type": "sena", "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "frn3le03ob09re2aud01", "coverimg": "frn3le03ob09re2img05.jpg", "images": [{"image": "frn3le03ob09re2img05.jpg", "text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0"}, {"image": "frn3le03ob09re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Coraline</span> : All\u00f4 ?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Charlotte</span> : All\u00f4,  Coraline ? C'est Charlotte.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Coraline</span> : Salut, Charlotte ! Comment \u00e7a va ?</br>", "id": 1, "time": "100"}, {"image": "frn3le03ob09re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Charlotte</span> : \u00c7a va bien, merci. Qu'est-ce que tu as fait hier soir ?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Coraline</span> : Eh bien, je suis sortie avec Pierre.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Charlotte</span> : O\u00f9 avez-vous d\u00e9cid\u00e9 de vous rencontrer ?", "id": 2, "time": "5500"}, {"image": "frn3le03ob09re2img02.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Coraline</span> : Nous sommes all\u00e9s au cin\u00e9ma. Nous avons vu un film d'horreur. C'est un admirateur de ces films ! </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Charlotte</span> : Ah oui !  G\u00e9nial !</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Coraline</span> : Oui, c'\u00e9tait bien. Tu connais ma passion pour les films de zombies. Nous avons pris du pop-corn.", "id": 3, "time": "13700"}, {"image": "frn3le03ob09re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Charlotte</span> : \u00c0 quelle heure es-tu rentr\u00e9e chez toi ?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Coraline</span> :  Vers 23h.  Et toi, qu'est-ce que tu as fait ?", "id": 4, "time": "27000"}, {"image": "frn3le03ob09re2img01.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Charlotte</span> : Je n'ai pas voulu sortir. Jean et moi sommes rest\u00e9s \u00e0 la maison et avons regard\u00e9 des s\u00e9ries t\u00e9l\u00e9vis\u00e9es. Les unes apr\u00e8s les autres.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Coraline</span> : J'y crois pas ! Comment c'\u00e9tait ? </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Charlotte</span> : Nous avons regard\u00e9 10 \u00e9pisodes. C'\u00e9tait g\u00e9nial !</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Coraline</span> : Oui, \u00e7a s'entend !</br>", "id": 5, "time": "31800"}]}}], "_data": []}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "text", "id": 2, "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "audio", "value": "frn3le03ob09re3aud01"}], "_data": []}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Je peux parler de films.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Je peux parler de mes exp\u00e9riences pass\u00e9es.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Je peux poser des questions et y r\u00e9pondre.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Quelles \u00e9missions t\u00e9l\u00e9vis\u00e9es aimez-vous regarder \u00e0 la t\u00e9l\u00e9vision&nbsp;?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "Quels films aimez-vous regarder&nbsp;?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "O\u00f9 regardez-vous des films et des \u00e9missions t\u00e9l\u00e9vis\u00e9es&nbsp;?", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Demandez \u00e0 votre camarade :", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "Regardons un film ou une \u00e9mission t\u00e9l\u00e9vis\u00e9e !", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "img_path": "", "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0]}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Coraline et Char