ass=\"italic\">ne</span> + avoir + <span class=\"italic\">pas</span> + participe pass\u00e9. </br> Quand vous posez une question, vous mettez le verbe <span class=\"italic\">avoir</span> en premier.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Forme\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Verbe r\u00e9gulier\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Affirmative\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"J'ai regard\u00e9 la t\u00e9l\u00e9vision.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"N\u00e9gative\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Nous n'avons pas regard\u00e9 la t\u00e9l\u00e9vision.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Interrogative\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Avez-vous regard\u00e9 la t\u00e9l\u00e9vision ?\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "Voici des mots qu'on utilise pour parler de ce qu'on a fait la nuit derni\u00e8re.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "hier soir", "type": "name"}, {"content": "la soir\u00e9e derni\u00e8re", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adverbe)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : J'ai regard\u00e9 un film hier soir.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn3le03ob09aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "le zombie", "type": "name"}, {"content": "une personne morte qui marche", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom m.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple :  Je n'aime pas les zombies.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn3le03ob09aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"content": "frn3le03ob09re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Interrogez vo